      "RUTHIE: Hold on. Hold on! Hold on!\nELLIOTT: Ruthie, you’re fine. I’m not even driving that fast.\nRO: It’s your birthday, bitch. It’s her birthday... You’re legal now. Now you got legal buttcheeks.\nRUTHIE: Oh, my god. You can’t say shit like that, Ro.",
      "CHELSEA: They’re like, they’re a medical marvel, right ?\nELLIOTT: That’s true.\nCHELSEA: They cure our UTI’s. We need them. They fight for us, we should fight for them.\nCHELSEA: So... you said you’re leaving town really soon, right?",
